  "adaptations": [
    "Protocol 17 typed team preference, roster teams/mode and bounded absolute team totals replace original client-ID/TeamMgr messages.",
    "Checked per-peer assignment survives world recreation while original client preference remains immutable; reconnect is fresh.",
    "Original team frag limit includes departed members and existing empty teams.",
    "Original localized team names/join text, HUD icon and CFragInfo team columns/stable draw-time ranking; bounded owned CPU/GPU surfaces replace engine surfaces.",
    "Source initial narrow-column zero, strict row limit, scrunch spacing and second-team fallback typo remain explicit.",
    "Independent client PvP fixture builds without a dedicated binary; all commercial resources remain external."
  ]
